Maintainer: Twilight <twilight@aliveos.org>
Depends: python
Section: python
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Twilight0/curl-cffi-builder
Description: Browser TLS fingerprint impersonation for Python
 curl-impersonate binding (Chrome/Safari TLS fingerprints) built for
 Android. Unlocks yt-dlp --impersonate and bot-aware scraping on Termux.
 Wheels come from curl-cffi-builder releases; the cffi dependency is
 built locally and needs: pkg install clang libffi.
